--- !u!114 &1789150108
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 1789150105}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 117a639d71e6cf745b41812c4c74569e, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  blackOverlay: {fileID: 1179441521}
  storyText: {fileID: 426400250}
  gameSceneName: Glade
  fadeDuration: 1
  lineDelay: 0.9
  lines: []
  fullStory: "Long before you awaken, the Spirit Realm was whole.\nFive Primordial
    Spirits\u2014Earth, Fire, Ice, Lightning, and Life\u2014kept balance across the
    land. At the center of all life stood the Glade of Origins, a sanctuary where
    spirits, humans, and creatures coexisted.\n\nBut balance never lasts.\n\nFrom
    deep beneath the world, an ancient entity known only as The Dark One stirred.
    Whispering promises of dominion, it corrupted one spirit after another. The Primordials,
    once guardians, twisted into monstrous tyrants, shattering the harmony they had
    sworn to protect.\n\nTheir fall tore the world apart.\n\nThe Great Runes, symbols
    of their power and unity, were fractured and scattered into the farthest corners
    of the realm. Without them, the Dark One\u2019s influence spread like a plague.\n\nTo
    preserve the last light, the remaining pure spirits poured their fading power
    into a child\u2014a final hope.\n\nThat child\u2026\nis you."
